---

<footer class="py-8 bg-[#111827] border-t border-gray-800">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
    <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-2">
      OGDevSecOps — Soluciones de software para empresas.
    </p>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-4">© 2026 OGDevSecOps · México</p>
    <a
      href={LINKEDIN_COMPANY}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="text-gray-400 text-sm hover:text-[#3b82f6] transition-colors duration-200"
    >
      LinkedIn
    </a>
  </div>
</footer>
